/F1 8.5 Tf
12.5 TL
(   [Problem Statement]: Contrast informal phrasal verbs with formal Latinate verbs in scientific publications, providing a comprehensive translation matrix.) Tj
T*
(   [Detailed Step-by-Step Answer]:) Tj
T*
(   1. The Rhetorical Register Divide:) Tj
T*
(   Phrasal verbs \(base verb + prepositional or adverbial particle\) are native Germanic) Tj
T*
(   constructions characterized by informal, conversational vitality. However, formal academic peer) Tj
T*
(   review demands single-word Latinate or French-derived verbs that embody emotional detachment,) Tj
T*
(   semantic precision, and concision.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   2. Comprehensive Academic Translation Matrix:) Tj
T*
(   - "carry out" -> conduct, execute, perform, implement) Tj
T*
(   - "find out" -> discover, determine, ascertain, deduce) Tj
T*
(   - "look into" -> investigate, examine, inspect, scrutinize) Tj
T*
(   - "break down" -> degrade, decompose, lyse, catabolize) Tj
T*
(   - "set up" -> assemble, configure, establish, instantiate) Tj
T*
(   - "point out" -> indicate, observe, note, highlight) Tj
T*
(   - "bring about" -> induce, elicit, cause, precipitate) Tj
T*
(   - "turn into" -> convert, transform, differentiate) Tj
T*
(   - "rule out" -> exclude, eliminate, discount) Tj
T*
(   - "give off" -> emit, release, discharge) Tj
T*
(   - "back up" -> corroborate, substantiate, validate) Tj
T*
(   - "put forward" -> propose, postulate, hypothesize) Tj
T*
ET

