(   [Problem Statement]: Analyze phrasal verbs with 'bring' \('bring about', 'bring down', 'bring up'\) in research communications.) Tj
T*
(   [Detailed Step-by-Step Answer]:) Tj
T*
(   1. Formal Substitutions in Scientific Manuscripts:) Tj
T*
(   - Bring about:) Tj
T*
(   - Meaning: Causing an event or chemical transformation to occur.) Tj
T*
(   - Formal Replacement: Elicit, precipitate, induce, cause, trigger.) Tj
T*
(   - Example: "Thermal shock induced the expression of heat-shock chaperones.") Tj
T*
(   - Bring down:) Tj
T*
(   - Meaning: Decreasing temperature, pressure, or glucose levels.) Tj
T*
(   - Formal Replacement: Lower, reduce, attenuate, depress.) Tj
T*
(   - Example: "Insulin administration reduced blood glucose levels to normoglycemic thresholds.") Tj
T*
(   - Bring up:) Tj
T*
(   - Meaning: Mentioning a topic for discussion during an academic defense.) Tj
T*
(   - Formal Replacement: Broach, raise, introduce.) Tj
T*
(   - Example: "The thesis committee raised critical questions regarding vector safety.") Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(--------------------------------------------------------------------------------) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
ET
BT
/F2 8.5 Tf
12.5 TL
(>> Solution to Question 29:) Tj
T*
ET
BT
/F1 8.5 Tf
12.5 TL
(   [Problem Statement]: Examine precision in technical quantitative adjectives: 'negligible', 'marginal', 'appreciable', 'substantial'.) Tj
T*
(   [Detailed Step-by-Step Answer]:) Tj
T*
(   1. The Quantitative Calibrating Spectrum:) Tj
T*
(   When describing experimental effects, adjectives establish quantitative boundaries:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   2. Adjective Continuum:) Tj
T*
(   - Negligible:) Tj
T*
(   - So small, trifling, or minute that it can be safely disregarded without affecting empirical) Tj
T*
(   conclusions:) Tj
T*
(   - "The background fluorescence signal in the blank well was negligible \(< 0.1%\).") Tj
T*
(   - Marginal:) Tj
T*
(   - At the very border of significance; minor, borderline, or barely discernible:) Tj
T*
(   - "The mutant strain displayed a marginal increase in ethanol tolerance \(p = 0.048\).") Tj
T*
(   - Appreciable:) Tj
T*
(   - Sufficiently large or distinct to be easily noticed, measured, or recognized:) Tj
T*
(   - "Western blot analysis revealed an appreciable accumulation of recombinant protein.") Tj
T*
(   - Substantial:) Tj
T*
(   - Considerably large, significant, robust, and meaningful:) Tj
T*
(   - "The CRISPR-engineered crop exhibited a substantial 40% increase in drought resilience.") Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(--------------------------------------------------------------------------------) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
