T*
(   2. Actionable Lifelong Learning Strategies:) Tj
T*
(   - Etymological Root Deconstruction:) Tj
T*
(   - Systematically dissect unfamiliar terminology into Greek/Latin roots, prefixes, and suffixes.) Tj
T*
(   Recognizing that 'omnis' means all, 'potens' means powerful, and '-cyte' means cell instantly) Tj
T*
(   demystifies 'omnipotent cell' \(pluripotent / totipotent\).) Tj
T*
(   - Corpus-Based Reading of High-Impact Journals:) Tj
T*
(   - Read peer-reviewed publications \(Nature, Cell, Science, Nucleic Acids Research\) with an) Tj
T*
(   active lexical notebook, highlighting recurrent collocations, signposting transitions, and) Tj
T*
(   formal Latinate verbs.) Tj
T*
(   - Eliminating Conversational Crutches:) Tj
T*
(   - Practice converting spoken procedural descriptions into formal prose: consciously replace) Tj
T*
(   'set up' with 'configure', 'look into' with 'investigate', and 'find out' with 'ascertain'.) Tj
T*
(   - Collocation Mapping:) Tj
T*
(   - Never memorize isolated words in isolation; record complete functional noun-verb and) Tj
T*
(   adjective-noun frameworks \(e.g., "elicit a response", "refractory to treatment", "corroborate a) Tj
T*
(   hypothesis"\).) Tj
T*
(   - Result: Establishes effortless academic fluency, ensuring graduate theses, patent claims, and) Tj
T*
(   journal submissions command immediate professional respect.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
